  "bodyComparisonNormalization": "Compare literal-preserving JavaScript ASTs after erasing TypeScript syntax and unwrapping the explicitly listed checked readers. Runtime checks remain in work; this is not a claim they erase. Each retained original top-level function, class constructor/method/accessor, initializer and test body is matched. Static and instance methods have separate keys.",
